# Forms

- Prefer `react-hook-form` for form state management
- Prefer `zod` for schema validation
- Keep forms keyboard-aware
- Prevent keyboard overlap on inputs
- Keep focused inputs visible while typing
- Show validation feedback near inputs
- Disable submit actions during async operations
- Provide loading, error and success feedback
- Prefer controlled and reusable form components
- Keep form logic isolated from presentation components
